\"0 0 512 545.5\"><path d=\"M256 94.5l6 2.5 192 80 10 4.5V224h-32v176h32v80H48v-80h32V224H48v-42.5l10-4.5 192-80zm0 35L106 192h300zM112 224v176h32V224h-32zm64 0v176h32V224h-32zm64 0v176h32V224h-32zm64 0v176h32V224h-32zm64 0v176h32V224h-32zM80 432v16h352v-16H80z\"></path></svg></span></div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg h-col-md h-col-auto style-457-outer style-local-26-c154-outer\">\n                      <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c154\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-1 h-px-md-1 h-px-1 v-inner-lg-1 v-inner-md-1 v-inner-1 style-457 style-local-26-c154 position-relative\">\n                        <!---->\n                        <!---->\n                        <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-start align-self-md-start align-self-start\">\n                          <!---->\n                          <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c156\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-459 style-local-26-c156 position-relative h-element\">\n                            <!---->\n                            <!---->\n                            <div class=\"\">\n                              <p>Good corporate governance and management for enhanced efﬁciency and service through internal capacity development and resource alignment</p>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-6 h-col-md-6 h-col-12 style-519-outer style-local-26-c157-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c157\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-ui-empty-state-container h-px-lg-2 h-px-md-2 h-px-2 v-inner-lg-2 v-inner-md-2 v-inner-2 style-519 style-local-26-c157 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100\">\n                <!---->\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-colibri-component=\"section\" data-colibri-id=\"26-c82\" id=\"content\" class=\"h-section h-section-global-spacing d-flex align-items-lg-center align-items-md-center align-items-center style-464 style-local-26-c82 position-relative\">\n    <!---->\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"h-section-grid-container h-section-fluid-container\">\n      <!---->\n      <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c83\" class=\"h-row-container gutters-row-lg-0 gutters-row-md-0 gutters-row-2 gutters-row-v-lg-0 gutters-row-v-md-0 gutters-row-v-2 style-465 style-local-26-c83 position-relative\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"h-row justify-content-lg-center justify-content-md-center justify-content-center align-items-lg-stretch align-items-md-stretch align-items-stretch gutters-col-lg-0 gutters-col-md-0 gutters-col-2 gutters-col-v-lg-0 gutters-col-v-md-0 gutters-col-v-2\">\n          <!---->\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-466-outer style-local-26-c84-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c84\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-466 style-local-26-c84 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-start align-self-md-start align-self-start\">\n                <!---->\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c85\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-469 style-local-26-c85 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <p>The company underwent structural re-organization that has experienced an increase the number of its operational regions and further devolved its activities to each of the geopolitical zones.</p>\n                    <p>This is complemented by the company’s overall focus of having the right mix in human Capital to deliver on the key corporate strategic objectives. </p>\n                    <p>To this end, the company will strive to achieve the following strategic objectives that ensure that human resources are aligned to the business strategies and initiatives:</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c195\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-522 style-local-26-c195 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <ol>\n                      <li>Talent management</li>\n                      <li>Developing leadership capability</li>\n                      <li>Organizational culture realignment to strategy and</li>\n                      <li>Enhancing staff welfare and retention strategies; and facilities are available for use, in good and optimal condition.</li>\n                      <li>Providing suitable work environment by ensuring that</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-474-outer style-local-26-c99-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c99\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-ui-empty-state-container h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-474 style-local-26-c99 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100\">\n                <!---->\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-colibri-component=\"section\" data-colibri-id=\"26-c100\" id=\"content-2\" class=\"h-section h-section-global-spacing d-flex align-items-lg-center align-items-md-center align-items-center style-475 style-local-26-c100 h-overflow-hidden position-relative\">\n    <!---->\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"h-section-grid-container h-section-fluid-container\">\n      <!---->\n      <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c101\" class=\"h-row-container gutters-row-lg-0 gutters-row-md-0 gutters-row-2 gutters-row-v-lg-0 gutters-row-v-md-0 gutters-row-v-2 style-476 style-local-26-c101 position-relative\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"h-row justify-content-lg-center justify-content-md-center justify-content-center align-items-lg-stretch align-items-md-stretch align-items-stretch gutters-col-lg-0 gutters-col-md-0 gutters-col-2 gutters-col-v-lg-0 gutters-col-v-md-0 gutters-col-v-2\">\n          <!---->\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-477-outer style-local-26-c102-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c102\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-ui-empty-state-container h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-477 style-local-26-c102 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100\">\n                <!---->\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-478-outer style-local-26-c103-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c103\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-478 style-local-26-c103 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-start align-self-md-start align-self-start\">\n                <!---->\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c105\" class=\"h-global-transition-all h-heading style-480 style-local-26-c105 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"h-heading__outer style-480 style-local-26-c105\">\n                    <!---->\n                    <!---->\n                    <h5 class=\"\">Remuneration</h5>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c106\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-481 style-local-26-c106 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <p>Glovtex remuneration policy is established on merit and fairness, in accordance with industry standard and the achievement of individual and corporate goals. Our compensation policy, aims to:</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c196\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-523 style-local-26-c196 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <ul>\n                      <li>recognize the responsibilities, results and quality of the professional contribution of every employee on our team</li>\n                      <li>Promote race, multicultural and gender equality in line with our corporate culture, while respecting the principles of diversity, equality, equal opportunities</li>\n                      <li>Enhancement of knowledge and professionalism of personnel</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                      <br>\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','26-revision-v1','','','2021-09-30 16:11:44','2021-09-30 16:11:44','',26,'http://staging.glovtex.com/?p=1323',0,'revision','',0),(1329,1,'2021-09-30 16:12:30','2021-09-30 16:12:30','{\"name\":\"hop-content\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"hop-section\",\"props\":{\"anchor\":false,\"name\":\"About\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"about\"}},\"children\":[{\"name\":\"hop-row\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"hop-column\",\"id\":\"26-c4\",\"parentId\":\"26-c3\",\"partialId\":26,\"styleRef\":419,\"type\":\"content\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":50,\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"custom\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":\"90\"}}}}}}}},{\"name\":\"hop-column\",\"id\":\"26-c5\",\"parentId\":\"26-c3\",\"partialId\":26,\"children\":[{\"name\":\"hop-heading\",\"parentId\":\"26-c5\",\"index\":0,\"id\":\"26-c6\",\"partialId\":26,\"styleRef\":421,\"type\":\"content\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"About Us<br>\"}},{\"name\":\"hop-heading\",\"parentId\":\"26-c5\",\"index\":1,\"id\":\"26-c7\",\"partialId\":26,\"styleRef\":422,\"type\":\"content\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"We have highly skilled and experienced individuals ensuring that deadlines are met in an efficient, but cost effective manner\"}},{\"name\":\"hop-text\",\"parentId\":\"26-c5\",\"index\":2,\"id\":\"26-c8\",\"partialId\":26,\"styleRef\":423,\"type\":\"content\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"<p>Glovtex Telecommunication Limited is an engineering company specializing in the development of Telco (Core\\/IN, Rollout and Maintenance) solutions for the GSM and wireless communication industry<\\/p>\"}}],\"styleRef\":420,\"type\":\"content\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":50,\"uni