\"name\":\"hop-heading\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"Provides value added satellite connectivity able to transport data for Internet \\/Intranet applications, Video and Voice over IP - (VoIP) and in general public or private networks\"},\"id\":\"71-c35\",\"parentId\":\"71-c29\",\"partialId\":71,\"styleRef\":241,\"type\":\"content\",\"slot\":null,\"index\":0,\"domuuid\":\"71-c72\"},{\"name\":\"hop-text\",\"slot\":null,\"parentId\":\"71-c29\",\"index\":1,\"id\":\"71-c36\",\"partialId\":71,\"styleRef\":242,\"type\":\"content\",\"domuuid\":\"71-c73\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"<p>The shared services (TDMA) allow several remote stations to share the same network in time division.&nbsp;The dedicated services communicate within each other without the need of a hub and on single carrier per channel:<\\/p><p><strong>Point-to-Point links (SCPC)<\\/strong> -- SCPC (Single Channel Per Carrier).<\\/p><p><strong>Star Networks (TDMA)<\\/strong> -- TDMA (Time Division Multiple Access) \\u2013 Central Hub Required<\\/p><p><strong>Point to Multi-Point (Mesh)<\\/strong> -- TDMA (Time Division Multiple Access) \\u2013 Not having to pass via the Central Hub<\\/p><p><strong>Multi-Point with Multi-Point and Star<\\/strong> - Allows all the remotes to access internet \\/ Intranet via the main Hub (in Star topology mode) and to communicate within (or with) each other in single hop (In mesh topology mode) without having to pass by the main Hub (and therefore with the delay of a single hop), depending on the different IP classes pre-assigned to the single sub-networks.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\"}}],\"styleRef\":236,\"type\":\"content\",\"domuuid\":\"71-c69\"},{\"name\":\"hop-column\",\"style\":{\"descendants\":{\"outer\":{\"columnWidth\":{\"type\":\"custom\",\"custom\":{\"value\":\"50\",\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"media\":{\"mobile\":{\"order\":1}}}}},\"id\":\"71-c37\",\"parentId\":\"71-c28\",\"partialId\":71,\"styleRef\":244,\"type\":\"content\",\"domuuid\":\"71-c68\"}],\"id\":\"71-c28\",\"parentId\":\"71-c27\"