ty</p>\n                    <p>ZERO Lost Time Injuries</p>\n                    <p>ZERO Incidence/Accident</p>\n                    <p> ZERO Road Accident</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"1404-c31\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-573 style-local-1404-c31 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <p><strong>Quality Management System</strong> - Glovtex Telecommunication is&nbsp;in the process of obtaining ISO 9001:2015 QMS Certiﬁcation from Bureau Veritas</p>\n                    <p><strong>Safety Management System</strong> - Glovtex Telecommunication is in the process of obtaining ISO 45001 Occupational Health &amp; Safety Certiﬁcation from Bureau Veritas</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-561-outer style-local-1404-c10-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"1404-c10\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-2 h-px-md-2 h-px-2 v-inner-lg-2 v-inner-md-2 v-inner-2 style-561 style-local-1404-c10 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-center align-self-md-center align-self-center\">\n                <!---->\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"1404-c11\" class=\"d-block style-562 style-local-1404-c11 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"h-image__frame-container-outer\">\n                    <div class=\"h-image__frame-container\">\n                      <!---->\n                      <!---->\n                      <img src=\"http://staging.glovtex.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/image-094.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-598 s