              <div class=\"h-global-transition-all\">[colibri_copyright]© {year} {site-name}. Created for free using WordPress and\n                    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://colibriwp.com\" rel=\"noopener\">Colibri</a>[/colibri_copyright]</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>','footer_post','','inherit','closed','closed','','50-revision-v1','','','2021-10-02 14:25:03','2021-10-02 14:25:03','',50,'http://staging.glovtex.com/?p=1563',0,'revision','',0),(1565,1,'2024-02-08 10:20:51','2024-02-08 10:20:51','<!----><p></p>\n    <!----><br>\n    <!----><p></p>\n        <!----><p></p>\n          <!----><p></p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><br>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n<h4>We Help You Achieve the Right Solution</h4>\n                  <!----><br>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n<p>We have highly skilled and experienced individuals ensuring that deadlines are met in an efﬁcient, but cost effective manner</p>\n        <!----><p></p>\n          <!----><p></p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!---->\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><br>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n<h4>The Company</h4>\n                  <!----><br>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n<p><strong>Glovtex Telecommunication Limited</strong> is an engineering company specializing in the development of Telco (Core/IN, Rollout and Maintenance) solutions for the GSM and wireless communication industry</p>\n<p>We are dedicated to offer a customer-centric approach to Technology projects, implementations and constructions in vivid contract to the more traditional approach</p>\n<p>Glovtex Telecommunication Limited serves several companies, all dominant players in their sectors: Telecom vendors, Service Providers, Mobile Operators, construction companies and other Information &amp; Communication businesses</p>\n    <!----><br>\n    <!----><p></p>\n      <!----><p></p>\n        <!----><p></p>\n          <!----><p></p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n<br><!---->\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!----><p></p>\n                              <!----><br>\n                              <!----><p></p>\n<h4>Telecom Vendors &amp; Mobile Operators</h4>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!---->\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><br>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n<h4>Network Rollout, Deployment and Maintenance</h4>\n                  <!----><br>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n<p>Sites Acquisition, Planning &amp; Zoning, Build-To-Suit Tower Development, Shelters and Equipment Room Installation, Pylons Provisioning and Site management, Antenna &amp; Cable Installation</p>\n<p>System Integration, NRO, Network Operations &amp; Maintenance</p>\n<p>(Adequate Resources) – BSC, RNC, MSC, Gateways (Packet/ Circuit)</p>\n    <!----><br>\n    <!----><p></p>\n      <!----><p></p>\n        <!----><p></p>\n          <!----><p></p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!----><p></p>\n                              <!----><br>\n                              <!----><p></p>\n<h5>VSAT Technology </h5>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!---->\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><br>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n<h5>Provides value added satellite connectivity able to transport data for Internet /Intranet applications, Video and Voice over IP - (VoIP) and in general public or private networks</h5>\n                  <!----><br>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n<p>The shared services (TDMA) allow several remote stations to share the same network in time division.&nbsp;The dedicated services communicate within each other without the need of a hub and on single carrier per channel:</p>\n<p><strong>Point-to-Point links (SCPC)</strong> -- SCPC (Single Channel Per Carrier).</p>\n<p><strong>Star Networks (TDMA)</strong> -- TDMA (Time Division Multiple Access) – Central Hub Required</p>\n<p><strong>Point to Multi-Point (Mesh)</strong> -- TDMA (Time Division Multiple Access) – Not having to pass via the Central Hub</p>\n<p><strong>Multi-Point with Multi-Point and Star</strong> - Allows all the remotes to access internet / Intranet via the main Hub (in Star topology mode) and to communicate within (or with) each other in single hop (In mesh topology mode)<br>\n                      without having to pass by the main Hub (and therefore with the delay of a single hop), depending on the different IP classes pre-assigned to the single sub-networks.</p>\n<p>\n                      <br>                    </p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!---->\n    <!----><br>\n    <!----><p></p>\n      <!----><p></p>\n        <!----><p></p>\n          <!----><p></p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!----><p></p>\n                              <!----><br>\n                              <!----><p></p>\n<h4>Area of Specialization</h4>\n                        <!----><br>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n                            <!---->\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                    <!----><br>\n                    <!----><p></p>\n<h5>Our Solutions</h5>\n                  <!----><br>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n<p>We deliver substantial complex projects on time and within budget. Our engagement guarantees a dual commitment to quality of service and technical expertise.</p>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                      <!----><p></p>\n                        <!---->\n                      <!----><p></p>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n<a h-use-smooth-scroll=\"true\" href=\"\" data-colibri-id=\"71-c53\"><!----><!----> See project                            <!--Icon by Icons8 Line Awesome (https://icons8.com/line-awesome)--><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" id=\"long-arrow-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 545.5\"><path d=\"M339 180.5l96 96 11.5 11.5-11.5 11.5-96 96-22.5-23L385 304H64v-32h321l-68.5-68.5z\"></path></svg></a><br>\n              <!----><br>\n              <!----><p></p>\n                <!----><p></p>\n                  <!----><p></p>\n                      <!----><p></p>\n                        <!---->\n                      <!----><p></p>\n                        <!----><p></p>\n                          <!----><p></p>\n<a h-use-smooth-scroll=\"true\" href=\"\" data-colibri-id=\"71-c59\"><!--