\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"h-row justify-content-lg-center justify-content-md-center justify-content-center align-items-lg-stretch align-items-md-stretch align-items-stretch gutters-col-lg-0 gutters-col-md-0 gutters-col-2 gutters-col-v-lg-0 gutters-col-v-md-0 gutters-col-v-2\">\n          <!---->\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-466-outer style-local-26-c110-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c110\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-466 style-local-26-c110 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-start align-self-md-start align-self-start\">\n                <!---->\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c111\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-469 style-local-26-c111 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <p>The company underwent structural re-organization that has experienced an increase the number of its operational regions and further devolved its activities to each of the geopolitical zones</p>\n                    <p>This is complemented by the company’s overall focus of having the right mix in human Capital to deliver on the key corporate strategic objectives.</p>\n                    <p>To this end, the company will strive to achieve the following strategic objectives that ensure that human resources are aligned to the business strategies and initiatives:</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c112\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-522 style-local-26-c112 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <ol>\n                      <li>Talent management</li>\n                      <li>Developing leadership capability</li>\n                      <li>Organizational culture realignment to strategy and</li>\n                      <li>Enhancing staff welfare and retention strategies; and facilities are available for use, in good and optimal condition.</li>\n                      <li>Providing suitable work environment by ensuring that</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-474-outer style-local-26-c113-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c113\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-ui-empty-state-container h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-474 style-local-26-c113 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100\">\n                <!---->\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-colibri-component=\"section\" data-colibri-id=\"26-c114\" id=\"content-2\" class=\"h-section h-section-global-spacing d-flex align-items-lg-center align-items-md-center align-items-center style-475 style-local-26-c114 h-overflow-hidden position-relative\">\n    <!---->\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"h-section-grid-container h-section-fluid-container\">\n      <!---->\n      <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c115\" class=\"h-row-container gutters-row-lg-0 gutters-row-md-0 gutters-row-2 gutters-row-v-lg-0 gutters-row-v-md-0 gutters-row-v-2 style-476 style-local-26-c115 position-relative\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"h-row justify-content-lg-center justify-content-md-center justify-content-center align-items-lg-stretch align-items-md-stretch align-items-stretch gutters-col-lg-0 gutters-col-md-0 gutters-col-2 gutters-col-v-lg-0 gutters-col-v-md-0 gutters-col-v-2\">\n          <!---->\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-477-outer style-local-26-c116-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c116\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-ui-empty-state-container h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-477 style-local-26-c116 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100\">\n                <!---->\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"h-column h-column-container d-flex h-col-lg-auto h-col-md-auto h-col-auto style-478-outer style-local-26-c117-outer\">\n            <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c117\" class=\"d-flex h-flex-basis h-column__inner h-px-lg-0 h-px-md-0 h-px-0 v-inner-lg-0 v-inner-md-0 v-inner-0 style-478 style-local-26-c117 position-relative\">\n              <!---->\n              <!---->\n              <div class=\"w-100 h-y-container h-column__content h-column__v-align flex-basis-100 align-self-lg-start align-self-md-start align-self-start\">\n                <!---->\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c118\" class=\"h-global-transition-all h-heading style-480 style-local-26-c118 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"h-heading__outer style-480 style-local-26-c118\">\n                    <!---->\n                    <!---->\n                    <h5 class=\"\">Remuneration</h5>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c119\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-481 style-local-26-c119 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <p>Glovtex remuneration policy is established on merit and fairness, in accordance with industry standard and the achievement of individual and corporate goals. Our compensation policy, aims to:</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-colibri-id=\"26-c120\" class=\"h-text h-text-component style-523 style-local-26-c120 position-relative h-element\">\n                  <!---->\n                  <!---->\n                  <div class=\"\">\n                    <ul>\n                      <li>recognize the responsibilities, results and quality of the professional contribution of every employee on our team</li>\n                      <li>Promote race, multicultural and gender equality in line with our corporate culture, while respecting the principles of diversity, equality, equal opportunities</li>\n                      <li>Enhancement of knowledge and professionalism of personnel</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                      <br>\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','26-revision-v1','','','2023-09-26 08:01:48','2023-09-26 08:01:48','',26,'http://staging.glovtex.com/?p=1587',0,'revision','',0),(1588,1,'2023-09-26 08:01:48','2023-09-26 08:01:48','{\"name\":\"hop-header\",\"id\":\"45-h1\",\"type\":\"header\",\"ui\":{\"isSelected\":true,\"isHovered\":false},\"partialId\":45,\"styleRef\":34,\"children\":[{\"name\":\"hop-navigation\",\"props\":{\"name\":\"Navigation\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"navigation\"},\"anchor\":false,\"backup\":{\"overlap\":{\"menu\":{\"descendants\":{\"item\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":{\"value\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"right\":{\"value\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"bottom\":{\"value\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"left\":{\"value\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"padding\